THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This application downloads and uses the NLLB-200-distilled-600M translation
model at runtime. That model is released by Meta AI under CC-BY-NC 4.0, which
permits NON-COMMERCIAL use only.

    https://huggingface.co/facebook/nllb-200-distilled-600M

The MIT licence above covers THIS application's source code. It does not
relicense the model. If you intend to use Typing Translate commercially you
must swap in a differently-licensed translation model (for example an Opus-MT
model under a permissive licence) or obtain your own rights from Meta.

Bundled binaries in the release archive:
  - CTranslate2            MIT
  - PySide6 / Qt           LGPLv3
  - NVIDIA CUDA runtime    NVIDIA CUDA EULA (redistributable)
